{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25966","headline":"秋暮山中怀李端公益 · 鲍溶","name":"秋暮山中怀李端公益","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧事与日远，秋花仍旧香。\n前年绣衣客，此节过此堂。\n侍臣不自高，笑脱绣衣裳。\n眠云有余态，入鸟不乱行。\n我恐云岚色，损君鞍马光。\n君言此何言，且共覆前觞。\n古人重一笑，买日轻金装。\n日尽秉烛游，千年不能忘。\n君言此何言，明日皆异乡。\n明日非今日，山下道路长。\n一从山下来，天地再炎凉。\n此中会难得，梦君马玄黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}